                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "I agree we could test this in qemu.  If we can't, I'm ok accepting this as is because there's some unit test coverage here, and in my read, the worst thing that happens is that >255 bus numbers continue to not work, which is where we were at before.\n\nWould like to see the uint16 vs 32 thing sorted below, then LGTM."
